OL,3,GNEWSACovid tests liar nurse can return
OL,4,Ato work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nursing home manager who lied to her
OL,7,Fstaff about positive Covid-19 tests at
OL,8,Fa care home where seven people died has
OL,9,Fbeen allowed to return to work.
OL,11,FThe Nursing and Midwifery Council (NMC)
OL,12,Fwas told that, during the pandemic,
OL,13,FJoanne Burchell "allowed" staff members
OL,14,Fwith the virus to work at the Holmesley
OL,15,FNursing Home in Sidford, Devon.
OL,17,FA 2024 inquest into the deaths of the
OL,18,Fseven elderly people who died at the
OL,19,Fhome found that measures to protect
OL,20,Fresidents from the virus were not
OL,21,F"effectively or consistently" followed
OL,22,Fby staff.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
