OL,3,GNEWSACovid tests liar nurse can return
OL,4,Ato work
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurchell was initially suspended, but
OL,7,Fan NMC panel has now ruled she can
OL,8,Freturn to nursing with conditions
OL,9,Fplaced on her practising.
